    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45715" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφηβ-ος</span></b> , hyperdor. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφᾱβος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥβη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one arrived at adolescence</i> (i. e. the age of <i><span class="en">
				18
			</span></i> years, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				8.105
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιδιετές</span>
			; in Persia <i><span class="en">
				16
			</span></i> or <i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i> years, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.2.8
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Lycurg.
				76
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				42.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1156
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				959.12
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Chios</span>), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τοὺς ἐφήβους ἐγγραφῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ax.</u>
					366e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἐφήβων ἐστὶ καὶ ἤδη εἴκοσι
					ἐτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Teles
					p.50
				</span></i>
			 H.: generally, <i>boy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλός ἐστιν ἔ. ὁ σός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLit.Lond.</u>
					52
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>young girl</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>kind of cup</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Steph.Com.
				1.5
			</span></i>, Philem.Lex. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				11.469a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>throw of the dice,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				7.427.5
			</span></i> (Antip. Sid.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> a woman's <i>shoe</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				7.61
			</span></i>.</div>
